Z||000018||The Fieromaster||07-17-2001||02:57 PM||||Mine does it too..<P>***Taking applications***<BR>Wanted...<BR>One female to ride in passenger seat of 1 Pontiac Fiero.  The Position will include sitting in 1 Fiero seat to end the flapping of 1 Fiero seatbelt.  To do this applicant will wear 1 Fiero seatbelt around their body.  Talking to 1 Fiero driver is not required but is optional!  Please respond by sending Resume to 1badfiero@biohazardracing.com<BR><P>------------------<BR>      <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">        <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||10
