Z||000029||LZeitgeist||07-18-2001||08:45 AM||||Actually, the sheepskin is to make wearing the seatbelt more comfortable for people who are shorter in stature than average... however, come to think of it, it just *may* break up the airflow around the belt enough to keep the wind from making it flap...<P>Hmmmmmmm...||||reg||1
